### Textile ERP API: VS Code ke andar se chalane ke liye
### VS Code men "REST Client" extension (Huachao Mao) install karen,
### phir har request ke upar "Send Request" likha aayega, us par click karen.
### Pehle "Login" chalayen: baqi requests uska token khud utha leti hen.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api
@token = {{login.response.body.accessToken}}
@refreshToken = {{login.response.body.refreshToken}}

### Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Login (super admin: super admins ka code; "npm run superadmin:code" se dekhen)
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "companyCode": "YAHAN-SUPER-ADMIN-CODE",
  "email": "admin@example.com",
  "password": "your-password"
}

### Login (company admin / user: company code ke saath)
# @name companyLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "companyCode": "YAHAN-COMPANY-CODE",
  "email": "waqas@example.com",
  "password": "Waqas-Pass-123"
}

### Me (main kon hun)
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### List super admins
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/super-admins?page=1&limit=25
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create super admin
# @name created
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/super-admins
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ali Khan",
  "email": "ali@example.com",
  "password": "Ali-Pass-12345"
}

### Update super admin (naam badalna / isActive false = band)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/v1/super-admins/{{created.response.body.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ali Raza",
  "isActive": true
}

### Reset super admin password
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/super-admins/{{created.response.body.id}}/reset-password
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "newPassword": "Reset-Pass-12345"
}

### List services (ids yahan se milengi)
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/services
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Add service
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/services
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "WASHING",
  "name": "Washing",
  "kind": "PROCESS"
}

### Register company (services baad men di jayengi)
# @name company
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/companies
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Waqas Textile",
  "contactPerson": "Waqas Owais",
  "phone": "0300-1234567",
  "address": "Faisalabad",
  "admin": {
    "name": "Waqas Owais",
    "email": "waqas@example.com",
    "password": "Waqas-Pass-123"
  }
}

### List companies
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/companies?page=1&limit=25
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Company details
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/companies/{{company.response.body.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Update company (isActive false = band)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/v1/companies/{{company.response.body.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "0300-7654321",
  "isActive": true
}

### Company ka naya code (purana foran band)
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/companies/{{company.response.body.id}}/new-code
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Company ko services dena (List services wali ids)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/v1/companies/{{company.response.body.id}}/services
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "serviceIds": []
}

### Ek service kai companies ko dena (URL men service id, Body men company ids)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/v1/services/YAHAN-SERVICE-ID/companies
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "companyIds": []
}

### Service kin companies ke paas he
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/services/YAHAN-SERVICE-ID/companies
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Audit log
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/audit-logs?page=1&limit=25
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Refresh token (naya token joda)
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{refreshToken}}"
}

### Change password (iske baad dobara Login karna hoga)
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/auth/change-password
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "currentPassword": "your-password",
  "newPassword": "New-Password-123"
}

### Logout (is device se)
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/auth/logout
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{refreshToken}}"
}

### ===== Company admin: apne users (pehle company admin ke code+email+password se login karen) =====

### Company admin login
# @name caLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "companyCode": "YAHAN-COMPANY-CODE",
  "email": "waqas@example.com",
  "password": "Waqas-Pass-123"
}

### Naya user (serviceId: company admin ke login jawab men services[].id)
# @name newUser
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/users
Authorization: Bearer {{caLogin.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ali Operator",
  "email": "ali@example.com",
  "password": "Ali-Pass-12345",
  "services": [
    { "serviceId": "YAHAN-SERVICE-ID", "access": "FULL" }
  ]
}

### Users ki list
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/users?page=1&limit=25
Authorization: Bearer {{caLogin.response.body.accessToken}}

### User ki detail
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/users/{{newUser.response.body.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{caLogin.response.body.accessToken}}

### User ki services badalna (poori list)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/v1/users/{{newUser.response.body.id}}/services
Authorization: Bearer {{caLogin.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "services": [
    { "serviceId": "YAHAN-SERVICE-ID", "access": "VIEW" }
  ]
}

### User ka naam badalna / band karna
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/v1/users/{{newUser.response.body.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{caLogin.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "isActive": true
}

### User ka password reset
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/users/{{newUser.response.body.id}}/reset-password
Authorization: Bearer {{caLogin.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "newPassword": "Ali-New-Pass-1"
}

### Service screen: companies with hasService (checkbox list)
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/services/YAHAN-SERVICE-ID/company-options
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Give a service to ticked companies (only adds)
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/services/YAHAN-SERVICE-ID/companies
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "companyIds": ["YAHAN-COMPANY-ID"] }

### ---------- Step 3: Grey inward (client admin token) ----------
### Add a customer
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/customers
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "code": 130, "name": "AZ Textiles" }

### Add a quality
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/qualities
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "CANVAS 10X7/72X30=65.50\"" }

### Continue numbering from the old system
PUT {{baseUrl}}/v1/grey-lots/numbering
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "nextLotNo": 2437, "nextTypeNo": 613 }

### Add a grey lot
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/grey-lots
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "inwardDate": "2026-10-13", "customerId": "YAHAN-CUSTOMER-ID", "qualityId": "YAHAN-QUALITY-ID", "inwardMeters": 2000, "pieces": 28, "dcNo": "5011" }

### List lots
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/grey-lots?page=1&limit=25
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Active toggle
PUT {{baseUrl}}/v1/grey-lots/YAHAN-LOT-ID/active
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "isActive": false }

### Approve
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/grey-lots/YAHAN-LOT-ID/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
